    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you arent a doctor but i really dont want to go to the clinic if i dont have to. it's mostly just annoying and i'm kind of broke right now lol. is there any way i can tell if it's just a fungus? like if it's ringworm, wouldn't an over the counter stuff like clotrimazole just fix it pretty quick? i'm worried if i go to a doctor they'll just charge me a bunch for something simple.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
