      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i literally just looked at it in the mirror and it's not even that red, it's just a bit blotchy. if it was something serious like an infection or whatever, wouldn't it be way more painful or like... swollen? honestly i feel fine otherwise, no fever or anything. \n\ncan u just tell me if there's any specific way it looks if it's definitely ringworm? like if it has a certain shape or something? i'm really trying to avoid the bill if i can just treat it myself with some cream from the drugstore.",
